ource\": \"Reddit\",\n    28→        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n    29→      }\n    30→    ]\n    31→  },\n    32→  {\n    33→    \"productName\": \"GitHub Copilot\",\n    34→    \"title\": \"VS Code v1.102 June 2026 Update with Autopilot\",\n    35→    \"description\": \"Microsoft's June 2026 VS Code update turns on Autopilot by default and adds background sending for agent sessions. The update continues to enhance GitHub Copilot integration with agent mode workflows and Model Context Protocol (MCP) support improvements.\",\n    36→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    37→    \"url\": \"https://visualstudiomagazine.com/articles/2025/07/14/vs-code-v1-102-doubles-down-on-github-copilot-and-ai-enhanced-development.aspx\",\n    38→    \"date\": \"2026-06-14\",\n    39→    \"community_feedback\": [\n    40→      {\n    41→        \"quote\": \"Reddit discussion mentions custom agent mode features and terminal execution capabilities\",\n    42→        \"source\": \"Reddit r/GithubCopilot\",\n    43→        \"sentiment\": \"neutral\"\n    44→      }\n    45→    ]\n    46→  },\n    47→  {\n    48→    \"productName\": \"Devin\",\n    49→    \"title\": \"Devin Desktop v3.1.7 with Agent/Editor Mode Smoothing\",\n    50→    \"description\": \"Devin Desktop v3.1.7 brings smoother Agent/Editor experience with the switch added to collapsed-sidebar titlebar, unified search icon to open agent search, and improved switching so auxiliary windows no longer close and restore. Renamed 'Devin CLI' settings to 'Devin Local' and added notification for agent sign-in failures.\",\n    51→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    52→    \"url\": \"https://docs.devin.ai/desktop/changelog\",\n    53→    \"date\": \"2026-06-10\",\n    54→    \"community_feedback\": []\n    55→  },\n    56→  {\n    57→    \"productName\": \"Devin\",\n    58→    \"title\": \"Devin Desktop v3.0.28 Migration and Performance Fixes\",\n    59→    \"description\": \"Release v3.0.28 hardened migration from Windsurf on Windows to preserve shortcut icon, improved file context handling in Devin Local agent, increased proxy authentication timeout, and fixed issues with stdio MCP servers on Windows. Enterprise customers received simplified model picker pricing view.\",\n    60→    \"updateType\": \"bugfix\",\n    61→    \"url\": \"https://docs.devin.ai/desktop/changelog\",\n    62→    \"date\": \"2026-06-06\",\n    63→    \"community_feedback\": []\n    64→  },\n    65→  {\n    66→    \"productName\": \"Devin\",\n    67→    \"title\": \"Devin Desktop v3.0.21 Reset Migration Command\",\n    68→    \"description\": \"Added a new 'Reset migration from Windsurf' command in the command palette that resets Devin Desktop settings and gives a second chance to import extensions and settings from Windsurf, addressing login issues users experienced after initial migration.\",\n    69→    \"updateType\": \"bugfix\",\n    70→    \"url\": \"https://docs.devin.ai/desktop/changelog\",\n    71→    \"date\": \"2026-06-04\",\n    72→    \"community_feedback\": []\n    73→  },\n    74→  {\n    75→    \"productName\": \"Devin\",\n    76→    \"title\": \"Windsurf Rebranded to Devin Desktop\",\n    77→    \"description\": \"Major rebranding event: Windsurf is now Devin Desktop. The over-the-air update transitioned the AI code editor name while preserving all user plans, pricing, extensions, and settings automatically with no action required from users.\",\n    78→    \"updateType\": \"announcement\",\n    79→    \"url\": \"https://docs.devin.ai/desktop/changelog\",\n    80→    \"date\": \"2026-06-02\",\n    81→    \"community_feedback\": [\n    82→      {\n    83→        \"quote\": \"The rebrand from Windsurf to Devin Desktop was seamless for users\",\n    84→        \"source\": \"Releasebot.io\",\n    85→        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n    86→      }\n    87→    ]\n    88→  },\n    89→  {\n    90→    \"productName\": \"GitHub Copilot\",\n    91→    \"title\": \"GitHub Copilot in VS Code May Release v1.101