ommending deterministic actions where possible\n- Focus on monitoring usage more closely\n\n### Related Updates\n- Microsoft 365 Copilot specialization updates mentioned in partner announcements\n- GitHub Copilot certifications offered as Advanced skilling options across both Enterprise and SMB tracks\n\n**Note**: While I searched with a domain filter for github.com, the most comprehensive information about these June 2026 updates appears to be documented on GitHub's official documentation site (docs.github.com) and discussed through various third-party sources, news outlets, and community platforms rather than github.com repository pages or blog posts.\n\nWould you like me to perform another search specifically on GitHub's documentation site (docs.github.com) or search for more specific aspects of these updates?\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."
